- Fixed: the on-screen virtual keyboard was disabled on the first connection of a session (reconnecting made it work again) — now it works right from the first connection.
- Fixed: the "Connect" button never switched to "Disconnect" after connecting, requiring an app restart to disconnect.
- Speech received from the remote NVDA is no longer shown as text on the Control screen — it's only spoken aloud (TTS), as intended.
- New option in Settings to share the current session's technical log, useful for reporting problems.
- Minor visual cleanup on the Connection and Settings screens.
